*INV:	please talk about the impact of stuttering on your daily life you can talk about your interactions with family and friends school and or work and your participation in community activities . 1805_18885
*PAR:	being a person who stutters there are many unique challenges that I face every day . 21495_35615
*PAR:	one of them for example is that my office is located in a very busy area where there's always people coming and going . 38057_50914
*PAR:	so naturally there are coworkers who come into say hello and it can be a real struggle for me to maintain a conversation outside of hi how are you how's it going . 59737_72594
*PAR:	and every time I start stuttering I'm reminded of how my parents do not and will not understand my stuttering in the way that I want them to . 96555_110413
*PAR:	it's my parents feelings that the shorter my sentences are the less likely I will be to stutter . 131575_139004
*PAR:	and that to me is just completely way off the beam . 151825_162905
*PAR:	I mean nobody has ever told me what I can and can't say and nobody will ever prevent me from saying what I want . 163585_174684
*INV:	what do you think causes stuttering ?
*PAR:	my impression is that stuttering has always been genetic . 213445_226904
*PAR:	I have not done any geniology research . 230825_240545
*PAR:	but it has been my understanding that my <great great> [/] great grandfather stuttered . 243925_255745
*PAR:	yet no one else in my family does . 259905_271025
*PAR:	and what I emphatically say is that my stuttering is not caused by nerves and it is not caused by stress . 279475_298195
*INV:	if you have received treatment for your stuttering tell me about your therapy experiences and the outcomes of these therapies . 301015_307495
*PAR:	well currently I am in speech therapy under the tutelage of a brilliant speech therapist and she knows who she is . 309596_315793
*PAR:	working with her and her staff I have been unlearning everything all my former s@l l@l p@l have taught me . 345865_352223
*PAR:	and what I am focused on now is just stuttering openly without any guilt or shame and loving it . 366986_373183
*PAR:	in fact I'm even open stuttering right now and I'm having a blast doing it . 396765_403263
*INV:	please describe what successful communication means to you and can you give an example of a positive communicative experience . 424625_433445
*PAR:	anytime you say what you want that is the quintessential definition of having a successful experience . 440035_448994
*PAR:	to me anytime that I refuse to let my words trap me that is how I define success . 468985_477944
*PAR:	every time I speak at a stuttering conference and people here my story yeah I think that's a great example of being successful . 492985_501944
*INV:	awesome . 524725_524925
*INV:	if you didn't stutter what might be different in your life ? 528656_531785
*PAR:	oh wow &-um okay I love working for the government . 538705_543635
*PAR:	however there have been times that I had thought about going to law school or possibly becoming a radio d@l j@l . 550605_555654
*PAR:	yes I sometimes would fall asleep dreaming of me behind the microphone . 577185_592005
*PAR:	and I realize that it would probably have been very difficult to make those dreams happen . 595948_608184
*PAR:	but being a motivational speaker in many ways it's allowed me to reach out and help others go for their dreams . 620085_634924
*PAR:	and in a way others who go for their dreams help me realize that just maybe I didn't miss out on my dreams after all . 650225_665064
*INV:	what else would you wanna say to students or the general public to help them learn about stuttering or ways to support people who stutter ? 690105_698565
*PAR:	working with people who stutter is not just about the academic component . 704245_714025
*PAR:	I do understand that the classroom plays a very big role but . 718765_730945
*PAR:	when you go for your masters in speech therapy you will learn that a speech therapist is a advocate friend confidant . 735506_746643
*PAR:	and sit back and enjoy the ride . 762155_773055
*PAR:	because there will be times when it's challenging . 774125_782465
*PAR:	they'll be times when you will wanna scream and curse . 784035_797455
*PAR:	and maybe you'll get angry that your Saturday nights are non existent . 797455_814834
*PAR:	but in the end you will have achieved the greatest gift of all and that is making a difference in someone's life . 820395_837774
